      "created_at": "2014-03-15T19:58:55.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>For determining effects of \"do damage to hero with the highest/lowest HP\", how do the Sentinels get counted? &nbsp;Do you use the four totals together or are they counted individually? &nbsp;In the first game I played with them, I had to spend a lot of time keeping The Idealist alive since she got blasted with all the \"hit the lowest\" damage.</p>",
