      "created_at": "2014-03-15T20:04:51.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Individually. Each is its own target, and yes, the idealist will get hit with the most damage when Lowest target is applied. In that situation I look to get Writhe's Signature card out, and heal up Idealist above Writhe :)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Looking for the card that lets you use another power a turn really helps to get Block going too.</p>",
