      "id": 95801,
      "name": "Edwin",
      "username": "Edwin",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/73ab20/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-03-16T06:32:34.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Semi-related question: what the dickens happens with the Sentinels and the Insula Primalis non-target damage cards?&nbsp; River of Lava and Primordial Plant Life both say they deal their damage to \"each hero\", rather than \"each hero target\".&nbsp; The Sentinels have four \"hero targets\", but are collectively just one \"hero\".&nbsp; So since the Sentinels virtually never have an Equipment to ditch, does River of Lava always deal 5 damage to each of them, or only to one of them?&nbsp; We played it the latter way last night, and it seemed more than adequately painful to them as it was.</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:22:44.376Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 0,
      "readers_count": 0,
      "score": 0.0,
