      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/silverleaf/{size}/2332_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-03-18T15:38:57.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>How does that work, thematically? Writhe suffers horrible burny pain, and Medico, Mainstay and the Idealist are miraculously immune to the effects of, you know, <em>a hot flowing stream of melty&nbsp;</em><em>lava</em>?</p><p>i just can't get my head around why that works.&nbsp;</p>",
